## 2) endpoint.json 长什么样（VS Code 需要解析）

### Windows（Named Pipe）

```json
{
  "app_id": "vix-broker",
  "protocol": 1,
  "family": "pipe",
  "name": "\\\\.\\pipe\\vix_audio_broker_....",
  "pid": 12345,
  "token_enabled": true
}
```

### Linux/macOS（Unix Socket）

```json
{
  "app_id": "vix-broker",
  "protocol": 1,
  "family": "unix",
  "path": "/tmp/vix_audio_broker_1000.sock",
  "pid": 12345,
  "token_enabled": true
}
```

> VS Code 侧要做的：

* `family === "pipe"` 用 `name` 去连接
* `family === "unix"` 用 `path` 去连接

