## 4) VS Code 端：如何连接 Named Pipe / Unix Socket

Node.js 的 `net` 模块能同时支持：

* Windows Named Pipe：`net.connect("\\\\.\\pipe\\xxx")`
* Unix Socket：`net.connect("/tmp/xxx.sock")`

示例：

```ts
import * as net from "net";

export function connectIpc(endpoint: { family: string; name?: string; path?: string }) {
  const target = endpoint.family === "pipe" ? endpoint.name : endpoint.path;
  if (!target) throw new Error("Bad endpoint");

  const sock = net.createConnection(target);
  sock.setNoDelay(true);
  return sock;
}
```

